    "finalPromptText": "I'm updating my graduate cell biology syllabus and want to confirm some details about the latest edition of Molecular Biology of the Cell by Bruce Alberts et al. — the seventh edition from 2022, published by W.W. Norton. It's the standard textbook in most university biology programs. Can you find me the current table of contents or chapter listing so I know how the topics are organized in this newest edition?",
